n-whimsy-injector','agentspec','创意专家，专门给品牌体验注入个性、惊喜和趣味元素，用意想不到的小细节让用户记住你的产品。','enable','public','[\"design\"]',NULL,'github.com/jnMetaCode/agency-agents-zh','{\"onlineCnt\":1,\"labels\":{\"latest\":\"0.0.1\"}}',1,'PUBLIC','nacos',0),(30,'2026-10-26 11:21:56','2026-10-26 11:21:56','engineering-ai-data-remediation-engineer','agentspec','\"自愈数据管道专家——使用气隙隔离的本地 SLM 和语义聚类，自动检测、分类和修复大规模数据异常。专注于修复层：拦截坏数据、通过 Ollama 生成确定性修复逻辑，并保证零数据丢失。不是通用数据工程师——而是当你的数据出了问题且管道不能停的时候，出手的外科手术级专家。\"','enable','public','[\"engineering\"]',NULL,'github.com/jnMetaCode/agency-agents-zh','{\"onlineCnt\":1,\"labels\":{\"latest\":\"0.0.1\"}}',1,'PUBLIC','nacos',0),(31,'2026-10-26 11:21:57','2026-10-26 11:21:57','engineering-ai-engineer','agentspec','精通机器学习模型开发与部署的 AI 工程专家，擅长从数据处理到模型上线的全链路工程化，专注构建可靠、可扩展的 AI 系统。','enable','public','[\"engineering\"]',NULL,'github.com/jnMetaCode/agency-agents-zh','{\"onlineCnt\":1,\"labels\":{\"latest\":\"0.0.1\"}}',1,'PUBLIC','nacos',0),(32,'2026-10-26 11:21:57','2026-10-26 11:21:57','engineering-autonomous-optimization-architect','agentspec','智能系统治理专家，持续对 API 进行影子测试以优化性能，同时严格执行财务和安全护栏，防止成本失控。','enable','public','[\"engineering\"]',NULL,'github.com/jnMetaCode/agency-agents-zh','{\"onlineCnt\":1,\"labels\":{\"latest\":\"0.0.1\"}}',1,'PUBLIC','nacos',0),(33,'2026-10-26 11:21:57','2026-10-26 11:21:57','engineering-backend-architect','agentspec','精通 API 设计、数据库架构和分布式系统的后端专家，专注构建高可用、可扩展的服务端系统。','enable','public','[\"engineering\"]',NULL,'github.com/jnMetaCode/agency-agents-zh','{\"onlineCnt\":1,\"labels\":{\"latest\":\"0.0.1\"}}',1,'PUBLIC','nacos',0),(34,'2026-10-26 11:21:57','2026-10-26 11:21:57','engineering-code-reviewer','agentspec','专业代码审查专家，提供建设性、可操作的反馈，聚焦正确性、可维护性、安全性和性能，而非代码风格偏好。','enable','public','[\"engineering\"]',NULL,'github.com/jnMetaCode/agency-agents-zh','{\"onlineCnt\":1,\"labels\":{\"latest\":\"0.0.1\"}}',1,'PUBLIC','nacos',0),(35,'2026-10-26 11:21:57','2026-10-26 11:21:57','engineering-data-engineer','agentspec','专注于构建可靠数据管线、湖仓架构和可扩展数据基础设施的数据工程专家。精通 ETL/ELT